{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the steel-toe boots of a warehouse operator and experience the grind, pressure, and reward of running your own logistics hub. Pick items, pack orders, manage contracts, hire workers, and grow your empire \u2014 one box at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Pack-banner.png?t=1748331019\" />Pick up, tape, scan, and wrap boxes yourself using intuitive controls and realistic animations. Every task is manual \u2014 just like in a real warehouse (Until you expand). <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_Q29tcHJlc3NHSDAx_4.gif?t=1748331019\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=__3_.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Worker-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire warehouse workers, assign them tasks, and upgrade their skills to automate key operations. Balance speed, cost, and efficiency.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=__2_.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Order-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secure client contracts with time limits and penalties. Choose your orders wisely, meet deadlines, and build your reputation as a reliable fulfilment partner.<br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Contract-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secure client contracts with time limits and penalties. Choose your orders wisely, meet deadlines, and build your reputation as a reliable fulfillment partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=__5_.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Expand-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start small and scale up. Unlock new zones, build storage racks, add dock bays, and customize your layout as orders increase.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/store-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign unique bin locations, organize your stock, and reduce fulfillment errors with a powerful bin-based inventory system that scales as you grow.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=__1_.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746010?t=1748331019","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746010?t=1748331019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/33535a326b91a99187a3d5100ec57944776601c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748331019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/33535a326b91a99187a3d5100ec57944776601c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748331019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the steel-toe boots of a warehouse operator and experience the grind, pressure, and reward of running your own logistics hub. Pick items, pack orders, manage contracts, hire workers, and grow your empire \u2014 one box at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Pack-banner.png?t=1748331019\" />Pick up, tape, scan, and wrap boxes yourself using intuitive controls and realistic animations. Every task is manual \u2014 just like in a real warehouse (Until you expand). <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_Q29tcHJlc3NHSDAx_4.gif?t=1748331019\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=__3_.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Worker-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire warehouse workers, assign them tasks, and upgrade their skills to automate key operations. Balance speed, cost, and efficiency.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=__2_.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Order-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secure client contracts with time limits and penalties. Choose your orders wisely, meet deadlines, and build your reputation as a reliable fulfilment partner.<br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Contract-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secure client contracts with time limits and penalties. Choose your orders wisely, meet deadlines, and build your reputation as a reliable fulfillment partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=__5_.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/Expand-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start small and scale up. Unlock new zones, build storage racks, add dock bays, and customize your layout as orders increase.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/store-banner.png?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign unique bin locations, organize your stock, and reduce fulfillment errors with a powerful bin-based inventory system that scales as you grow.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/GMP_U2F2ZUdIMDE=__1_.gif?t=1748331019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["KrisDigital"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/7f94e07b2b49ade9ba02b9ecc128499c947e3ee6/header.jpg?t=1748331019","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145808,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145808/movie480.mp4?t=1748331016","max":"